Decimal expansion of real number arising in self-avoiding and directed graphs belonging to eight-branching Cayley tree (Bethe lattice) generated by the Fuchsian group of a Riemann surface of genus two.

The 6 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `2`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A202151

